<h2 id="h-treestand-and-ground-blind-practicality">Treestand and Ground Blind Practicality</h2>
<p>This is where the Whitetail Maxx earns its name. A 31-inch axle-to-axle bow is easy to hang on a hook, lift on a haul rope and swing through shooting lanes. In a ground blind, it gives you more room for your elbow and the top cam.</p>
